cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HELIX in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "HELIX - Hybrid Envelope-multiparticle LInac eXplorer"
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python toolkit for end-to-end simulation of
  charged-particle linear accelerators: a TraceWin-compatible lattice
  language, an envelope (Sigma-matrix) solver, a multi-particle tracker
  with a 3-D particle-in-cell space-charge solver, a matching engine, a
  GUI workbench, and a scriptable batch CLI.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Pathak
    given-names: Abhishek
    affiliation: "Fermi National Accelerator Laboratory"
version: "v1.0.11"
date-released: 2026-07-28
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Accel-Toolkit/HELIX"
url: "https://github.com/Accel-Toolkit/HELIX"
keywords:
  - accelerator physics
  - beam dynamics
  - space charge
  - particle-in-cell
  - linear accelerator
  - PIP-II
